{"id":"n31502-1-11","stage":1,"title":"지갑 · 钱包","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31502-1-11-1","ko":"잃어버린 지갑 찾았다면서?","zh":"听说你找到了丢失的钱包？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잃어버린","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지갑","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾았다면서?","meaning":"取回，找回","explanation":"찾다：取回，找回；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"4","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"取回，找回","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"曾经失去、被夺走、寄存的或借出的东西再次收回。","pronunciation":["찯따"]}],"audio":"/audio/880a983466d2fc209c3a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31502-1-11-2","ko":"응. 돈은 없어졌는데 다행히 카드하고 신분증은 그대로 들어 있었어.","zh":"嗯。钱不见了，不过幸好卡和身份证还在里面。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈은","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어졌는데","meaning":"没有；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"없다：没有；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다행히","meaning":"幸运，万幸，走运","explanation":"다행히：幸运，万幸，走运","readings":[{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23910","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"카드하고","meaning":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","explanation":"카드：银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"카드","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71472","senseId":"7","lemma":"카드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신분증은","meaning":"身份证","explanation":"신분증：身份证；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"신분증","audio":"/audio/b88156503e28096ba12b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65903","senseId":"1","lemma":"신분증","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그대로","meaning":"照原样，就那么，原封不动地","explanation":"그대로：照原样，就那么，原封不动地","readings":[{"term":"그대로","audio":"/audio/ae35dc181aceaec58c58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36255","senseId":"1","lemma":"그대로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"7b75f0048465d767","term":"다행히","zh":"幸运，万幸，走运","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3","entryId":"23910","definition":"意外地运气好地。","pronunciation":["다행히"]},{"id":"62b41b5aaec6fef4","term":"카드","zh":"银行卡，储蓄卡，信用卡","audio":"/audio/62b41b5aaec6fef4bd83.mp3","entryId":"71472","definition":"在购物或接受服务后，可当场或过一段时间后付款的支付工具，是个呈方型的塑料片。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"b88156503e28096b","term":"신분증","zh":"身份证","audio":"/audio/b88156503e28096ba12b.mp3","entryId":"65903","definition":"证明自己身份或所属的文件或卡片。","pronunciation":["신분쯩"]},{"id":"ae35dc181aceaec5","term":"그대로","zh":"照原样，就那么，原封不动地","audio":"/audio/ae35dc181aceaec58c58.mp3","entryId":"36255","definition":"保持原来的模样或状态不变。","pronunciation":["그대로"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fefd0633485105c41783.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.592,"source":